# Line endings: the repo has no cross-platform normalization, and Windows
# clones (core.autocrlf=true) materialize CRLF where Linux build agents see
# LF. Build-tooling regexes in vite.config.mts (onBeforePageRender strip
# patterns) are written against \n; CRLF checkouts silently failed to strip
# the fallback <title>/description, breaking the prerender SEO gate
# (docs/BUILD_FAILURE_FIX.md). Normalize text sources to LF everywhere so
# every machine builds from byte-identical sources.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows scripts must stay CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets — never normalize
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
